{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "e0b7bf5c513d7904d97458eb7199b6fbf025173f6a74e6d3854b335f12d098f7", "ja": "いつもの？集まり", "zh": "老地方？老朋友聚会", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "cc39630b0c357ad0b8041b566bed2c694c4bcc0f1827e1a3f68f29da5f0ce65e", "ja": "入れ替わり二日目、麗花は静香たちを連れて\n志保の元を訪れる。ぎこちないながらも仲間\nたちと麗花として過ごした志保と、志保とし\nて過ごした麗花は、少しだけお互いのことが\nわかったような気がしたのだった。", "zh": "互换身份的第二天，丽花带着静香她们去拜访志保。志保虽然有些不自在，却以丽花的身份和伙伴们度过了时光；而以志保的身份度过时光的丽花，也觉得自己似乎稍微了解了彼此一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "396222ad7c768a2be154e748a9c949b175242b2d6952464bc1ad64b089365f05", "ja": "―入れ替わり二日目―", "zh": "―交换第二天―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "65d50ad7d65b19e0bf0d080b6b864e7bc86119583db26fe585e392ebcf74aef4", "ja": "んんっ……意外と普通に眠れちゃった。\n今日は、何すればいいんだろう。", "zh": "唔……居然意外地睡得挺安稳。\n今天该做些什么好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1002_se", "source_sha256": "907f495885a55eeaf98bc4c8a34896eab7df057cf196127a3c72505bcd514114", "ja": "ブーッ、ブーッ、ブーッ", "zh": "嘟——、嘟——、嘟——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "1c8080da3ffea1babaeddc96e28d246d5e57c7fb725ca3dccd74c27b59355e1d", "ja": "電話……あ、麗花さん。\nはい、もしもし。", "zh": "电话……啊，是丽花小姐。\n喂，你好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "18424a10e40689991f1c7075ed17f5fb387318dd0b95a157321c4e2fe974e25e", "ja": "「おはよう、麗花ちゃん！　よく眠れたかな？」", "zh": "「早上好，丽花！睡得好吗？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "997959fbfe2bd5d37eab2dbf54c5ec02571739a6e1ae408ce3f0b8c7884876ef", "ja": "麗花さ……、ん、ん。志保さん、おはようございます。\nはい、思ったよりもちゃんと寝られました。", "zh": "丽花小……咳、咳。志保小姐，早上好。\n是的，比想象中睡得好多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "7a80c0ff225d4d82e129ddfdd6b5e750b990183ae7b90fdd870ce93ed08de1a0", "ja": "「よかったぁ♪　それでね、今日なんだけど\nもうすぐ家にお友達が来ることになってるんだ！」", "zh": "“太好了♪然后呢，关于今天的事，\n马上就有朋友要来家里了哦！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "2949910093de64295541fc1731086d4f7facadf5a23faddf803888c2ab959037", "ja": "えっ……、お友達ですか！？\nもうすぐってそんな、突然言われても……！", "zh": "诶……朋友吗！？\n马上就要来？可你突然这么说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1008_se", "source_sha256": "2367dd8b14aa0905b20f7626610465b89d29b5f0570a461b1220cd61c5813edc", "ja": "ピンポーン", "zh": "叮咚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "e20284cc3cafbc244a33d9cdec93bf0c2cc4aafecb4afe49bafbc58896e75488", "ja": "おっはよ～！　麗花ちゃんの友達が来たよ～！", "zh": "早上好～！丽花的朋友来啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "71b8ee4fff3ed1e2e1de5a4d3825408ea9195ea383110b60cab6838022303d9f", "ja": "この声は……そういうこと。\nはーい、今開けます！", "zh": "这个声音是……原来如此。\n好——，这就开门！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1011_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "01300244ba65d5814100cbfcf4cd97924d6672bdaf97f419212451277b4051f0", "ja": "志保さん！　……じゃなくて。\n麗花さん、おはようございます♪", "zh": "志保小姐！……不对。\n丽花小姐，早上好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "3e9c7ea3f24f1e328361965da51dd1d3a55ae37f88f708595b9e112c25c18196", "ja": "おはよう。友達って言われて、誰かと思ったら……\nみんな、人が悪いわね。", "zh": "早上好。被叫作朋友，我还在想是谁呢……\n大家真是爱捉弄人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "46218b38cfc9da0de93a67614001fa451de855edc30129b978129ecbe6d982ea", "ja": "ふふっ、麗花さんの友達には違いないでしょ？", "zh": "呵呵，确实是丽花小姐的朋友吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "2b249d2f7375ac94d5b8538ac68ca18c00cbce9b95d155814bb71532badd37a7", "ja": "私も、今日は志保ちゃんだから、\n麗花ちゃんの友達として遊びに来たんだよ！", "zh": "我今天可是志保嘛，所以是作为丽花的朋友来玩的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "5454a55a9d3def2f7f223e2b077f9df3072fd31b24c32f7896cab1a449137d4f", "ja": "さーて、今日の麗花ちゃんは、\n友達にどんなおもてなしをしてくれるのカナ～？", "zh": "那么，今天的丽花会为朋友准备怎样的招待呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "685cb1dcc9700fcfcfd200835febe9378266a4239c4a8f967f33681dabfc35e5", "ja": "……。あ、私ですね。えっと……おもてなし……。\nじゃあ、とりあえず、部屋を片付けましょう。", "zh": "……。啊，轮到我了啊。那个……招待朋友……\n那么，总之先来打扫房间吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "2805dcb33886853d81ce5a175190bb9f8f3d9e0b95e75b86cac00e7436db39cc", "ja": "えー！\n麗花ちゃんは片付けたりしないんじゃないかな？", "zh": "诶——！\n丽花应该不会收拾吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "6a6ddee0966a1bf916dba2cbe5eab7800660289e3db5cbc7ab493071f1301046", "ja": "でも私……志保ならきっと、\n片付けようって言い出すと思いますよ。", "zh": "不过我……要是志保的话，我觉得肯定会主动提议收拾的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "23ee166ebaee81130f1184a712bedd54da57c3c7017d1ccd40b4ae9a23adb33a", "ja": "あ、そっか！　ではでは北沢志保、\n頑張ってお片付けを……応援しまーす♪", "zh": "啊，原来如此！那么，北泽志保，加油收拾吧……我会为你加油的——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "b72392dc927be18e65b9e9b65c8fe623c6fb50750a43c39b10ce95540396d7a0", "ja": "え？　ダメですよ、言い出しっぺなんだから。\nちゃんと働いてくだ……、働いて、志保！", "zh": "诶？不行哦，毕竟是你提议的嘛。\n好好干活……，干活，志保！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "59f67f78728653d237c9fe727b0728ad77229893e277bd52fc9572a77dac8ddf", "ja": "わ～、すっごく綺麗になったね！\nみんな、お疲れ様♪　おやつの時間でーす♪", "zh": "哇～，变得好干净呀！\n大家辛苦啦♪　点心时间到喽——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "e64e43e721fdf3df730db2531dedf28e366f4f320e207400fff0f6eba842af39", "ja": "はぁ……結局いつもの役割分担になりましたね。", "zh": "唉……结果还是变成平时那样分工了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "8dfc4768f8b3d12e7afb3f3680f194913b8f1f28ac933878971cef239bcfd13b", "ja": "しょうがないんじゃないかな～。片付けに関しては、\n元麗花ちゃん専門外だから……！", "zh": "没办法吧～。说到收拾的话，原本的丽花可是完全不擅长的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "85641c47504bb7afd5feb821dfe5676f943eb197921cf508cd613de33365c181", "ja": "でも、せっかく入れ替わりしてるんだから、\n本当はもっとちゃんとやらないとダメなんじゃない？", "zh": "不过，难得有机会互换身份，本来不是应该做得更像样一点吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "42e9043d7355550e89803854aa80d889df5ed43df7d93c6b3f65092db8a193cb", "ja": "ちゃんとって……たとえば何？", "zh": "你说的“好好做”……比如说要怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "f53761efa5f8edf032e92a7e21ca35d5922b7b6f6bc5861db38bfa9fd68932c9", "ja": "だから、もっとこう……、\n麗花さんらしいことをやってみるとか。", "zh": "所以，要不再多做些……比如，做点更有丽花姐风格的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1029_022ser", "source_sha256": "f068d02aad6bc7df2b50a077eac15b049523b8c13ce8a2ce44f3ff52d33cfaf2", "ja": "麗花さんらしいこと……？\nあっ、茜さんのプリン……？", "zh": "像丽花小姐会做的事……？啊，茜小姐的布丁……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "9a9a9f89d16fb1d773b92f24acabeff847b6fb03041499d22e581e44be4c22e7", "ja": "ちょちょちょちょーっと星梨花ちゃん！？\n確かにそれはすっごく麗花ちゃんらしいけど！！", "zh": "等等等等一下，星梨花！？\n确实，那真的很像丽花会做的事，可是！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "c654294b15784e9380bd766dc77f6f194e7e2855c04d8e73f8051cc3dc57c597", "ja": "茜ちゃんのプリン？　それがどうかしたの？", "zh": "小茜的布丁？那怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "ba7601c50b7a36b562d0a5561c6b22ddf1ddb80602cf2b7dc372b9577651a873", "ja": "確かに、そうかも……。\nすみません、茜さん。いただきます。", "zh": "确实，可能是这样……。\n对不起，茜。我吃了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1033_023aka", "source_sha256": "525071cc0b170036ecc09b64bc6d9042620bae66fb09cc10c54d5d40f0e0b5cb", "ja": "ニャー！　なんて無慈悲なっ！！\nでも、これも二人のデュオのため……なんだよね！？", "zh": "喵——！也太无情了吧！！  \n不过，这也是为了我们两人的双人组合……对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "280d08084301aedbce6f4d29714b8ae7de8d4d434c09f9c19349afe5dce16867", "ja": "そのはずです。\n……ちなみに、何か入れ替わりの効果はあったの？", "zh": "应该是这样。\n……顺便问一下，有没有产生什么交换效果？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "bd977f613ada422d4f6b94087e04bcc2a7855ab6b14ecaf92806ded7261ffd0f", "ja": "そうね……。麗花さんの言ってたこと、\n少しだけ、わかった気がするわ。", "zh": "是啊……感觉我好像稍微明白了一点，丽花小姐所说的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "e067b2ac30332ef12e22defd1bb6d7887bd91529a26f3e556a7c065dbc857975", "ja": "ふふっ♪　私も志保ちゃんのこと、\n前よりいっぱいわかったかも♪", "zh": "呵呵♪我好像也比以前更了解志保了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "f481b56f2f5334aa92dc6923195da574eef06ec881bb8d1ea2ecd52ab5dec5c3", "ja": "そうなんだ……。\nなら、いいステージになりそうですね。楽しみです！", "zh": "原来是这样……。\n那应该会是一场很棒的舞台。真让人期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1038_022ser", "source_sha256": "ac0946dabf0aac73c1c3024e3fb0ae0ad99fd117e3b65b8fca9497a70745c0d4", "ja": "あっ、もうこんな時間……。\nみなさん、お夕飯はどうするんですか？", "zh": "啊，都已经这个时间了……。\n大家晚饭打算怎么办呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1039_023aka", "source_sha256": "32bbee6c9e8b9a2741ab80d097ec3fddb40dc5468b846e90781a06c7b9889b62", "ja": "はいはーい！　茜ちゃんは、麗花ちゃんの手料理が\n食べたいな～？　あ、麗花ちゃんはしほりんのことね！", "zh": "我我我——！小茜想吃丽花亲手做的饭，对吧～？啊，我说的丽花是志保啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "d4c9e779f5ed94a1aae65e6bfbadb1428b8ec0d30fe074fa47dbc3faf1651448", "ja": "そうですね。うどんなら作れますけど、\n私も今日は『麗花さん』の手料理が食べてみたいな～♪", "zh": "是啊。乌冬面我倒是会做，不过今天我也想尝尝“丽花小姐”亲手做的料理呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "6c1f3b1f8a8ae0bac3b7fe270c60b4638963f6d86f694337cf3fa10fdffbc3df", "ja": "冷蔵庫の中のもの、なんでも好きに使って大丈夫だよ！\n牛タンとかアーティチョークとか、豆板醬とか♪", "zh": "冰箱里的东西，喜欢怎么用都可以哦！牛舌、洋蓟，还有豆瓣酱之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1042_033sih", "source_sha256": "44125883759bcdd07906fec12e51db3cb1e36787fdf8de4f9bb6d243a28bbe23", "ja": "そのラインナップで何を作れば……\nあ、でも、やってみます。今の私は麗花さんですから。", "zh": "按这个菜单，我该做什么才好……\n啊，不过，我会试试看的。因为现在的我就是丽花小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_05_1043_048rei", "source_sha256": "fe1de41e703384d263f6b90eb89b423207068152f1b23dd49789dececb7438df", "ja": "うんうん！\nそれくらい麗花ちゃんなら夕飯前だよね！", "zh": "嗯嗯！\n这种程度的话，对丽花来说就是小菜一碟，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
